# man/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# The usual roxygen2 convention is to gitignore man/ and regenerate it during
# the build. That works for CRAN, which builds from a source tarball that
# already contains the .Rd files. It does not work for install_github(), which
# does not run roxygen: if man/ is absent from the repository the package
# installs with zero help pages and ?cl_grid silently returns nothing.
